# Build context for docker/demo.Dockerfile: only what the image installs. Nothing else, so no local
# state, record, key seed or capture can reach the image.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!keys/ratchet-decisions.pub
!src/
!probity-ratchet-cases/pyproject.toml
!probity-ratchet-cases/README.md
!probity-ratchet-cases/LICENSE
!probity-ratchet-cases/src/
!docker/demo/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
